  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After the new login UI update, every time I get logged out of my account, I'm asked to enter a verification code sent to my email.\n\nBefore the update, if I got logged out but hadn't logged into any other accounts, I could log back in without needing another verification code.\n\nI'd really appreciate it if you could bring back the previous behavior, or at least add an option to remember trusted devices. It's pretty inconvenient having to take off my headset or grab my phone just to check my email and log back in, especially when I'm using the same account on the same device.\n\nI understand that verification codes are important for security, but having to enter one every time feels unnecessary when the device has already been verified.",
